 - contract: MNQ one micro has USD2 per index point, tick 0.25 point=$0.50/tick. Integer qty = floor(1000/(2*stop_distance_points)) at time order is PLACED using prior complete bars. If qty <1 => ineligible due strictly budget and account it (no invented fractional contracts). No manual cap10, no extra constraints unless native engine margin check with documented margin specs. Do not size after seeing fill outcome, don't add volatility filters or tune multipliers. Ensure proper qty for long and short, first fill OCO cancellation and daily limit; overlapping pending stop exposures risk real violation, log if native non-atomic. Example ATR=66.7 => stop 100.25pts after rounding => floor(1000/200.5)=4 MNQ.
 - B2 does not retain one-NQ unit size; gross dollar comparison to B0 is not like-for-like. Report R multiples, *actual nominal risk spent* and/or per $1000 ex-ante budget, risk deployment utilization, total MNQ contract sides, cap/skip count, position-size distribution.
 - predeclared primary realistic PROXY costs: MNQ commission USD1.25 PER CONTRACT PER FILL, adverse slippage 0.25 index points PER FILL (one MNQ tick), both order sides, PLUS bid-only missing ask caveat; log cost source "illustrative, NOT broker-verified". Zero-cost diagnostic permitted as companion of same B2 specification. Cost sensitivity not Phase4 unless cheap, avoid parameter search. Original NQ baseline full tick uses USD2.50 per contract/side and $20/point; comparison must note commission units vary. When possible separate missing ASK/spread explicitly and avoid double-count slippage.
 - Native Engine must enforce positive available cash/margin; if not verified, label margin uncertainty, don't claim prop feasibility.

Phase 2 deliver source_quality.json, source hashes, bar coverage, exact UTC timezone/DST and source symbol, contract multiplier/tick/cost map with reference and synthetic tests, original archive hash & byte count untouched; confidence labels VERIFIED vs proxy caveats. Include observations of missing 30m bins (do not silently drop 1m execution), data-provenance. Verify source actually contains through time cutoff; no protected period touched.

