Phase 4 execute full-history 2013-Jul14 2026 native ML4T event-driven B2 using memory-safe annual isolated subprocesses, ideally zero-cost + fee/slippage scenario. Preserve warmup and end-of-year carry / evaluate by Chicago entry session year; disclose boundary transitions and annual engine cash resets. Specifically inspect native ContractSpec multiplier=2, tick=.25, appropriate margin and handling of qty>1, commission PER_SHARE charge per contract per fill, 1-minute price feed retention in incomplete decision bars, time-exit at immediately next available 30m OPEN. Avoid broker native opposing STOP same-minute dual fills: if no native atomic OCO support, at least enumerate conflicts and conservative same-minute fill outcome bound, not claim OCO modeled perfectly. Don't hand-write execution simulator or posthoc PnL as native.
