codex
The annual jobs have completed through 2017. The cost model applies the declared $1.25 fee and 0.25-point adverse slippage to each MNQ contract on each fill. Early low-volatility periods create larger integer positions under the fixed-risk formula, so the per-contract fees are material. The 2013 ledger confirms the expected fee and slippage arithmetic and records native margin rejections as zero.
